[{"h":"Model: P3600-04-2AC","c":[]},{"h":"PON Ports: 4 × EPON","c":[]},{"h":"Port: 4 × 10G SFP+","c":[]},{"h":"Standards: IEEE 802.3ah EPON","c":[]},{"h":"Supports: Up to 1:64 Optical Split Ratio per PON Port","c":[]},{"h":"Installation: 1U 19-inch Rackmount","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 02 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The BDCOM P3600-04-2AC 4-Port EPON OLT is a high-performance Layer 3 Optical Line Terminal (OLT) designed for Internet Service Providers (ISPs), enterprise networks, and Fiber-to-the-Home (FTTH) deployments. Equipped with 4 EPON PON ports, 4 Gigabit Ethernet RJ45 uplink ports, 4 high-speed 10G SFP+ uplink ports, and dual hot-swappable AC power supplies, this carrier-grade OLT ensures exceptional reliability, scalability, and uninterrupted network performance.</p><p>Compliant with the IEEE 802.3ah EPON and CTC 2.1/3.0 standards, the P3600-04-2AC offers excellent interoperability with ONUs from multiple vendors. It supports advanced Layer 2 and Layer 3 networking features, including VLAN, QoS, ACL, IGMP Snooping, IPv4/IPv6 routing, and multicast services, making it an ideal solution for modern broadband access networks. Its compact 1U rackmount design allows for easy installation in data centers and telecom racks while delivering high-capacity fiber connectivity with low power consumption.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>4 EPON PON Ports</li><li>4 × Gigabit RJ45 Uplink Ports</li><li>4 × 10G SFP+ Uplink Ports</li><li>Dual Hot-Swappable AC Power Supplies</li><li>IEEE 802.3ah EPON Standard Compliant</li><li>Supports up to 1:64 Optical Split Ratio per PON Port</li><li>Layer 2 &amp; Layer 3 Switching and Routing</li><li>IPv4 &amp; IPv6 Dual Stack Support</li><li>Advanced QoS, VLAN, ACL &amp; Multicast Features</li><li>IGMP Snooping &amp; IGMP Proxy Support</li><li>CLI, Web GUI, SNMP, SSH &amp; Telnet Management</li><li>Secure Authentication &amp; Access Control</li><li>1U 19-inch Rackmount Design</li><li>Ideal for FTTH, FTTB, FTTO &amp; ISP Networks</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"VSOL V1600D4-DP EPON OLT 4 PORT 10G UPLINK","href":"/vsol-v1600d4-dp-epon-olt-4-port-10g-uplink","now":"43,000৳","old":"48,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E08EP-4S+ 8-Port EPON OLT Without 4 PON Card","href":"/ecom-e08ep-4s-8-port-epon-olt-without-4-pon-card","now":"39,500৳","old":"42,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600D8 8-Port EPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600d8-8-port-epon-olt","now":"75,000৳","old":"76,500৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1601E02-DP 2Port EPON OLT 10G UPLINK","href":"/V.SOL%20V1601E02-DP%202Port%20EPON%20OLT","now":"31,500৳","old":"36,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600D16 16-Port EPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600d16-16-port-epon-olt","now":"150,000৳","old":"155,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E08EP-4S+ 8 Port EPON OLT With 8 PON Card","href":"/ecom-e08ep-4s-8-port-epon-olt-with-8-pon-card","now":"59,000৳","old":"65,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V3600D8 8 Port 10G 1:256 Ratio EPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v3600d8-8-port-10g-1256-ratio-epon-olt","now":"345,000৳","old":"358,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E04EP-4S+RM 4-Port EPON OLT with 10G SFP+ Uplink – Rack Mount","href":"/ecom-e04ep-4srm-4-port-epon-olt-with-10g-sfp-uplink%E2%80%93rack-mount","now":"34,500৳","old":"35,300৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-XE08R 8-Port EPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-xe08r-8-port-epon-olt","now":"56,000৳","old":"58,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-XE04R 4-Port EPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-xe04r-4-port-epon-olt","now":"35,000৳","old":"36,500৳","single":""}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/bdcom-